Brand system
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
design/tokens.json comes from the OpenApps HQ "Tactile Studio" system
(openappshq/openapps, MIT). The green ramp beyond the shared green/50, 300,
700 and 950 steps and the Hertz pulse mark are original to this app.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Cleanup Scout
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The allowlist-only, review-first model (known cache locations only, protected
paths refused) is inspired by Mole (MIT). The scanner is an independent Swift
implementation that only measures and reports; no Mole source is included.
